  m_Name: 6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fullText: 'Entry 1


    We have decided to denominate the foreign object simply
    as "The

    Visitor". It seems to possess an electronic interior, covered by
    an

    extremely resistant metallic exterior. It is outputting all sorts of

    unknown
    signals, and I am starting to worry that our technology might

    not be advanced
    enough to comprehend it. Others are highly skeptical

    about its origins,
    thinking it might be someone playing a joke on us,

    but I am convinced such
    complexity can not be achieved on Proima.

    What an incredible discovery!'
